  "details": "Description\n\nI have had this frequent thing happening where my headset can't work where no one's avatars will load in unless I go into my meta menu which then they load. I have also had this other bug where i will randomly crash just by turning me head and I would need to quit VRC and then rejoin. These two issues has caused me not being able to enjoy the game.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nI've tried working on the debug and deleting the cache for avatars and such, and it barely helps keeping me on the game without crashing. I don't have any way to fix this, would you have any idea how I could? Thank for reading my response!\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Performance\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: Quest (platform: Android - Quest, store: Oculus, headset: Oculus Quest 2)\n\nrawPlatform: Android\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3p2-1921-15c4a824b2-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-10-18_20-54-42.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_26f2cfd2-9b63-438f-b989-13d1fc20be0a/1/file)",
